<!-- How I work (Mali 11/28): her real process for every service: consultation, plan, then working together. -->
<section class="band ab-how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center-head">
      <h2>How I <em>work</em></h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="ab-how-list">
      <li><span class="ab-n">1</span><h3>We start with a call</h3><p>On a free 20-minute Zoom call, you tell me about your business and what you need. Afterward, I send you a quote with exact prices, and nothing starts until you approve it.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ab-n">2</span><h3>We make a plan</h3><p>Next, we make a plan together on a Strategy Call. We go over who your best customers are and what makes you different, so there are no surprises once the work starts.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ab-n">3</span><h3>We work on it together</h3><p>You'll work directly with me the whole way. We go over the work together, and I make the changes you ask for. At the end, I show you how to manage things yourself. For a website or online booking, I also record a walkthrough video you can look back on.</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="ab-how-note">A lot of my clients end up feeling more like friends.</p>
  </div>
</section>

